{"id": "dc673021-6bc7-4a3e-8547-432dd1352456", "slug": "financial-saas-platform-metrics", "title": "Financial SaaS Platform Metrics", "description": "Financial Saas UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Financial SaaS Platform Metrics\"\ndescription: \"Financial Saas UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#00E55F\"\n  secondary: \"#09090B\"\n  accent: \"#008A39\"\n  background: \"#09090B\"\n  surface: \"#27272A\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"15px\"\n  control: \"15px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Financial SaaS Platform Metrics\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 18; favorites: 4; remixes: 0.\nTags: ui, css, dashboard, app, interface.\n## Overview\nFinancial Saas UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\nLive Telemetry Institutional Grade Analytics Real-time insights across global infrastructure assets. Optimize capital allocation with precision instruments designed for modern financial workflows. 100% Global coverage L…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Institutional Grade Analytics; 100%; < 24h; 1.25%; Axiom Capital; $14,250,000.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #00E55F, secondary #09090B, accent #008A39, background #09090B, surface #27272A, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Financial SaaS Platform Metrics</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#09090b] text-zinc-50 antialiased min-h-screen py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 selection:bg-[#00e55f]/30 selection:text-white flex flex-col items-center overflow-x-hidden\">\n\n    <!-- Header Section -->\n    <div class=\"max-w-6xl w-full mx-auto mb-16 relative z-10\">\n        <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-zinc-800/50 border border-zinc-700/50 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-300 mb-6 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n            <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#00e55f] animate-pulse\"></span>\n            Live Telemetry\n        </div>\n        <h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-4 text-white\">Institutional Grade Analytics</h2>\n        <p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl leading-relaxed\">\n            Real-time insights across global infrastructure assets. Optimize capital allocation with precision instruments designed for modern financial workflows.\n        </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Grid -->\n    <div class=\"max-w-6xl w-full mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-5 relative z-10\">\n\n        <!-- Column 1 (Spans 4) -->\n        <div class=\"md:col-span-4 flex flex-col gap-5\">\n            <!-- Global Coverage Card -->\n            <div class=\"relative rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-700/60 via-zinc-800/20 to-transparent p-[1px] shadow-2xl group transition-transform duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1\">\n                <div class=\"bg-[#09090b] rounded-[15px] h-48 p-6 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-center\">\n                    <canvas id=\"mapCanvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none opacity-60 mix-blend-screen\"></canvas>\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#09090b] to-transparent opacity-80 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-1 bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-white/70\">100%</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider\">Global coverage</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Approval Process Card -->\n            <div class=\"relative rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-700/60 via-zinc-800/20 to-transparent p-[1px] shadow-2xl group transition-transform duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1\">\n                <div class=\"bg-[#09090b] rounded-[15px] h-64 p-6 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-center justify-center\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,rgba(0,229,95,0.05)_0%,transparent_60%)] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                    <svg class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full p-4 pointer-events-none drop-shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(0,229,95,0.3)]\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 200\" style=\"transform: rotate(-90deg);\">\n                        <path d=\"M 100 20 A 80 80 0 1 1 20 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#27272a\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" />\n                        <path id=\"speed-arc\" d=\"M 100 20 A 80 80 0 0 1 170 140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#green-grad)\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" style=\"stroke-dasharray: 400; stroke-dashoffset: 400; transition: stroke-dashoffset 2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.5s;\" />\n                        <defs>\n                            <linearGradient id=\"green-grad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\">\n                                <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#00e55f\" />\n                                <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#008a39\" />\n                            </linearGradient>\n                        </defs>\n                    </svg>\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 text-center mt-4\">\n                        <p class=\"text-zinc-500 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\">Liquidity Velocity</p>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white mb-1\"><span class=\"text-[#00e55f]\">&lt;</span> 24h</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-sm\">Clearance process</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Animated Yield Rate Card (Remixed) -->\n            <div class=\"relative rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-700/60 via-zinc-800/20 to-transparent p-[1px] shadow-2xl group transition-transform duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1\">\n                <div class=\"bg-[#09090b] rounded-[15px] h-40 p-6 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between\">\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex justify-between items-start\">\n                        <div>\n                            <p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\">Base Yield Rate</p>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white\">1.25%</h3>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[#00e55f] bg-[#00e55f]/10 px-2 py-1 rounded text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:graph-up-linear\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n                            +4bps\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- WebGL-style Canvas Animation -->\n                    <canvas id=\"yieldCanvas\" class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-0 mix-blend-screen\"></canvas>\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#09090b]/80 via-transparent to-transparent pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Column 2 (Spans 5) -->\n        <div class=\"md:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-5\">\n            <!-- Funding Range Card -->\n            <div class=\"relative rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-700/60 via-zinc-800/20 to-transparent p-[1px] shadow-2xl group flex-grow min-h-[400px] transition-transform duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1\">\n                <div class=\"bg-[#09090b] rounded-[15px] h-full p-6 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between\">\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-8\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-zinc-800 to-zinc-900 border border-zinc-700/50 flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:buildings-linear\" class=\"text-zinc-300 text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-white\">Axiom Capital</h4>\n                                    <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500\">Active Deployment</p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:menu-dots-bold\" class=\"text-zinc-600 text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"mb-8\">\n                            <div class=\"text-zinc-500 text-sm font-medium mb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-600\"></span>\n                                Min: $50k\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-2\">\n                                <h3 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white\">$14,250,000</h3>\n                                <span class=\"text-zinc-500 font-medium text-sm\">USD</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-1.5 h-48 mt-auto relative z-10 w-full px-1\" id=\"bar-container\">\n                        <!-- Bars inserted via JS -->\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Background Elements -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#ffffff05_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#ffffff05_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:32px_32px] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-1/2 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#00e55f]/5 to-transparent pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Security Card -->\n            <div class=\"relative rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-700/60 via-zinc-800/20 to-transparent p-[1px] shadow-2xl transition-transform duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1 h-24\">\n                <div class=\"bg-[#09090b] rounded-[15px] h-full p-6 relative overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-between\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                        <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-zinc-800/50 border border-zinc-700/50 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-check-linear\" class=\"text-[#00e55f] text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <h4 class=\"text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-white\">Zero Hidden Fees</h4>\n                            <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500\">Transparent cost structure</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Column 3 (Spans 3) -->\n        <div class=\"md:col-span-3 flex flex-col gap-5\">\n            <!-- Retail Card -->\n            <div class=\"relative rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-700/60 via-zinc-800/20 to-transparent p-[1px] shadow-2xl transition-transform duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1 h-40\">\n                <div class=\"bg-[#09090b] rounded-[15px] h-full p-6 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-center\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:wallet-linear\" class=\"absolute top-6 right-6 text-zinc-800 text-4xl pointer-events-none\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-2 mb-1\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-medium\">Retail Min</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white mb-2\">$250,000</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800 pt-2\">Threshold for individual accredited accounts.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Corporate Card -->\n            <div class=\"relative rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-700/60 via-zinc-800/20 to-transparent p-[1px] shadow-2xl transition-transform duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1 h-40\">\n                <div class=\"bg-[#09090b] rounded-[15px] h-full p-6 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-center\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bank-linear\" class=\"absolute top-6 right-6 text-zinc-800 text-4xl pointer-events-none\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-2 mb-1\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-medium\">Corp Min</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white mb-2\">$5,000,000</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800 pt-2\">Threshold for institutional entities.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Animated Asset Allocation Card (Remixed) -->\n            <div class=\"relative rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-700/60 via-zinc-800/20 to-transparent p-[1px] shadow-2xl group flex-grow min-h-[160px] transition-transform duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1\">\n                <div class=\"bg-[#09090b] rounded-[15px] h-full p-6 relative overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-between\">\n\n                    <!-- WebGL-style Particles Canvas -->\n                    <canvas id=\"donutCanvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-0 mix-blend-screen opacity-80\"></canvas>\n\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 pr-2\">\n                        <p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\">Asset Allocation</p>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight mb-1\">75<span class=\"text-zinc-500 text-lg\">/</span>25</h3>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-zinc-500 mt-2\">\n                            <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#00e55f]\"></span> Debt\n                            <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-zinc-700 ml-1\"></span> Equity\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Pie/Donut Chart -->\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 w-20 h-20 shrink-0\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" class=\"w-full h-full transform -rotate-90 drop-shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(0,229,95,0.2)]\">\n                            <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"38\" fill=\"transparent\" stroke=\"#27272a\" stroke-width=\"10\"></circle>\n                            <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"38\" fill=\"transparent\" stroke=\"#00e55f\" stroke-width=\"10\" stroke-dasharray=\"238.7\" stroke-dashoffset=\"238.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" class=\"transition-all duration-[2000ms] ease-out\" id=\"donut-fill\"></circle>\n                        </svg>\n                        <!-- Center Core -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pie-chart-2-linear\" class=\"text-zinc-500 text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Glow effect -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute right-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-24 h-24 bg-[#00e55f] opacity-[0.03] blur-2xl rounded-full pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n\n            // 1. Reveal Animations for SVGs\n            setTimeout(() => {\n                const speedArc = document.getElementById('speed-arc');\n                if(speedArc) speedArc.style.strokeDashoffset = '100'; // 75% full\n\n                const donutFill = document.getElementById('donut-fill');\n                if(donutFill) donutFill.style.strokeDashoffset = '59.6'; // represents 75%\n            }, 300);\n\n            // 2. Bar Chart Generation\n            const barContainer = document.getElementById('bar-container');\n            const targetHeights = [20, 15, 30, 25, 45, 35, 60, 50, 80, 70, 95, 85, 100];\n\n            targetHeights.forEach((height, index) => {\n                const barWrapper = document.createElement('div');\n                barWrapper.className = 'w-full flex justify-center h-full items-end group';\n\n                const bar = document.createElement('div');\n                bar.className = 'w-[80%] rounded-t-[4px] transition-all duration-[1500ms] ease-out relative overflow-hidden';\n                bar.style.background = 'linear-gradient(to top, #27272a 0%, #3f3f46 50%, #00e55f 100%)';\n                bar.style.height = '0%';\n\n                // Add top highlight\n                const highlight = document.createElement('div');\n                highlight.className = 'absolute top-0 w-full h-[2px] bg-white opacity-40 mix-blend-overlay';\n                bar.appendChild(highlight);\n\n                barWrapper.appendChild(bar);\n                barContainer.appendChild(barWrapper);\n\n                setTimeout(() => {\n                    bar.style.height = `${height}%`;\n                }, 400 + (index * 60));\n            });\n\n            // 3. WebGL-Style Map Canvas\n            const mapCanvas = document.getElementById('mapCanvas');\n            const mapCtx = mapCanvas.getContext('2d', { alpha: true });\n            let mapParticles = [];\n\n            function initMap() {\n                const rect = mapCanvas.parentElement.getBoundingClientRect();\n                mapCanvas.width = rect.width;\n                mapCanvas.height = rect.height;\n                mapParticles = [];\n                for(let i=0; i<150; i++) {\n                    mapParticles.push({\n                        x: Math.random() * mapCanvas.width,\n                        y: Math.random() * mapCanvas.height,\n                        size: Math.random() * 1.5 + 0.5,\n                        speedX: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.2,\n                        speedY: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.2,\n                        opacity: Math.random() * 0.5 + 0.1\n                    });\n                }\n            }\n\n            function animateMap() {\n                mapCtx.clearRect(0, 0, mapCanvas.width, mapCanvas.height);\n                mapParticles.forEach(p => {\n                    p.x += p.speedX;\n                    p.y += p.speedY;\n                    if(p.x < 0) p.x = mapCanvas.width;\n                    if(p.x > mapCanvas.width) p.x = 0;\n                    if(p.y < 0) p.y = mapCanvas.height;\n                    if(p.y > mapCanvas.height) p.y = 0;\n\n                    mapCtx.beginPath();\n                    mapCtx.arc(p.x, p.y, p.size, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                    mapCtx.fillStyle = `rgba(0, 229, 95, ${p.opacity})`;\n                    mapCtx.fill();\n                });\n\n                // Draw connecting lines based on proximity\n                mapCtx.lineWidth = 0.5;\n                for(let i=0; i<mapParticles.length; i++) {\n                    for(let j=i+1; j<mapParticles.length; j++) {\n                        const dx = mapParticles[i].x - mapParticles[j].x;\n                        const dy = mapParticles[i].y - mapParticles[j].y;\n                        const dist = Math.sqrt(dx*dx + dy*dy);\n                        if(dist < 30) {\n                            mapCtx.beginPath();\n                            mapCtx.moveTo(mapParticles[i].x, mapParticles[i].y);\n                            mapCtx.lineTo(mapParticles[j].x, mapParticles[j].y);\n                            mapCtx.strokeStyle = `rgba(161, 161, 170, ${0.1 - dist/300})`;\n                            mapCtx.stroke();\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n                requestAnimationFrame(animateMap);\n            }\n\n            // 4. WebGL-Style Yield Line Canvas\n            const yieldCanvas = document.getElementById('yieldCanvas');\n            const yieldCtx = yieldCanvas.getContext('2d', { alpha: true });\n            let yieldTime = 0;\n            let yieldPoints = [];\n\n            function initYield() {\n                const rect = yieldCanvas.parentElement.getBoundingClientRect();\n                yieldCanvas.width = rect.width;\n                yieldCanvas.height = rect.height;\n                yieldPoints = Array.from({length: 40}, () => ({\n                    yOffset: Math.random() * 10 - 5,\n                    phase: Math.random() * Math.PI * 2\n                }));\n            }\n\n            function animateYield() {\n                yieldCtx.clearRect(0, 0, yieldCanvas.width, yieldCanvas.height);\n                yieldTime += 0.02;\n\n                const midY = yieldCanvas.height * 0.7;\n\n                // Draw gradient fill\n                yieldCtx.beginPath();\n                yieldCtx.moveTo(0, yieldCanvas.height);\n\n                for(let i=0; i<=yieldCanvas.width; i+=10) {\n                    const idx = Math.floor((i / yieldCanvas.width) * (yieldPoints.length - 1));\n                    const point = yieldPoints[idx] || yieldPoints[0];\n                    // Complex wave formula for organic feel\n                    const y = midY + Math.sin(i * 0.01 + yieldTime) * 15 + Math.cos(i * 0.005 - yieldTime * 1.5) * 10 + point.yOffset * Math.sin(yieldTime + point.phase);\n                    yieldCtx.lineTo(i, y);\n                }\n\n                yieldCtx.lineTo(yieldCanvas.width, yieldCanvas.height);\n                yieldCtx.closePath();\n\n                const gradient = yieldCtx.createLinearGradient(0, midY - 30, 0, yieldCanvas.height);\n                gradient.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(0, 229, 95, 0.2)');\n                gradient.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(0, 229, 95, 0)');\n                yieldCtx.fillStyle = gradient;\n                yieldCtx.fill();\n\n                // Draw solid line on top\n                yieldCtx.beginPath();\n                for(let i=0; i<=yieldCanvas.width; i+=5) {\n                    const idx = Math.floor((i / yieldCanvas.width) * (yieldPoints.length - 1));\n                    const point = yieldPoints[idx] || yieldPoints[0];\n                    const y = midY + Math.sin(i * 0.01 + yieldTime) * 15 + Math.cos(i * 0.005 - yieldTime * 1.5) * 10 + point.yOffset * Math.sin(yieldTime + point.phase);\n                    if(i === 0) yieldCtx.moveTo(i, y);\n                    else yieldCtx.lineTo(i, y);\n\n                    // Add subtle glow particles on the line\n                    if(i % 40 === 0 && i > 0 && i < yieldCanvas.width) {\n                         yieldCtx.save();\n                         yieldCtx.beginPath();\n                         yieldCtx.arc(i, y, 1.5, 0, Math.PI*2);\n                         yieldCtx.fillStyle = '#fff';\n                         yieldCtx.shadowBlur = 8;\n                         yieldCtx.shadowColor = '#00e55f';\n                         yieldCtx.fill();\n                         yieldCtx.restore();\n                    }\n                }\n                yieldCtx.strokeStyle = '#00e55f';\n                yieldCtx.lineWidth = 1.5;\n                yieldCtx.stroke();\n\n                requestAnimationFrame(animateYield);\n            }\n\n            // 5. WebGL-Style Donut Particles\n            const donutCanvas = document.getElementById('donutCanvas');\n            const donutCtx = donutCanvas.getContext('2d', { alpha: true });\n            let donutParticles = [];\n            let donutTime = 0;\n\n            function initDonut() {\n                const rect = donutCanvas.parentElement.getBoundingClientRect();\n                donutCanvas.width = rect.width;\n                donutCanvas.height = rect.height;\n                donutParticles = [];\n                // Create particles that will orbit the right side\n                const centerX = donutCanvas.width - 48; // Approx center of SVG\n                const centerY = donutCanvas.height / 2;\n\n                for(let i=0; i<60; i++) {\n                    donutParticles.push({\n                        angle: Math.random() * Math.PI * 2,\n                        radius: 38 + Math.random() * 25, // Orbit outside the SVG chart\n                        speed: (Math.random() * 0.02 + 0.005) * (Math.random() > 0.5 ? 1 : -1),\n                        size: Math.random() * 1.5 + 0.5,\n                        baseAlpha: Math.random() * 0.5 + 0.2\n                    });\n                }\n            }\n\n            function animateDonut() {\n                donutCtx.clearRect(0, 0, donutCanvas.width, donutCanvas.height);\n                donutTime += 0.01;\n\n                // SVG is positioned at right-6 (24px) + width 20 (80px), roughly calculated center\n                const centerX = donutCanvas.width - 56;\n                const centerY = donutCanvas.height / 2;\n\n                donutParticles.forEach(p => {\n                    p.angle += p.speed;\n                    // Introduce slight wobble\n                    const r = p.radius + Math.sin(donutTime * 5 + p.angle) * 3;\n                    const x = centerX + Math.cos(p.angle) * r;\n                    const y = centerY + Math.sin(p.angle) * r;\n\n                    donutCtx.beginPath();\n                    donutCtx.arc(x, y, p.size, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n\n                    // Pulse alpha\n                    const alpha = p.baseAlpha + Math.sin(donutTime * 10 + p.angle) * 0.2;\n                    donutCtx.fillStyle = `rgba(0, 229, 95, ${Math.max(0, alpha)})`;\n                    donutCtx.fill();\n                });\n\n                requestAnimationFrame(animateDonut);\n            }\n\n            // Initialization & Resize Handling\n            function initAllCanvases() {\n                initMap();\n                initYield();\n                initDonut();\n            }\n\n            window.addEventListener('resize', initAllCanvases);\n            initAllCanvases();\n            animateMap();\n            animateYield();\n            animateDonut();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "financial-saas-platform-metrics.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/financial-saas-platform-metrics.jpg", "source_name": "financial-saas-platform-metrics-DESIGN.md", "views": 162, "forks": 10, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T23:46:41.390822+00:00"}